# Gate Colossus: with no Gate Bot1 controls, affinity for Gates takes off nothing. Black Lotus and four Moxen make only
# seven mana, so the cast is refused (and Gate Colossus stays in hand); an Island played and tapped makes the eighth and
# it is cast for exactly {8}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Gate Colossus
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Gate Colossus.Cast(Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gate Colossus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Island; Gate Colossus
